-- `to update play` runs only while mode is "play"; the bare `to update` runs
-- otherwise (design decisions, Q5).
mode is "play"
playTicks is 0
otherTicks is 0
to update play
  playTicks is playTicks + 1
to update
  otherTicks is otherTicks + 1
to draw
  clear screen to black
  write "play {playTicks} other {otherTicks}" at 2, 2 in white on hud
run game with update and draw
